OL,3,GNEWSAStates boss apologises for Revenue
OL,4,AService backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the States of Guernsey has
OL,7,Fapologised for an "unacceptable"
OL,8,FRevenue Service backlog that has built
OL,9,Fup over 12 years.
OL,11,FIt comes as the service released a
OL,12,Freport stating the backlog of tax
OL,13,Freturns and other revenue documents was
OL,14,Fmuch larger than initially thought.
OL,16,FThe report found there were 106,444
OL,17,Foutstanding work items - including tax
OL,18,Fassessments, repayments and bereavement
OL,19,Fcases - at the end of August.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
