OL,3,GNEWSAStates boss apologises for Revenue
OL,4,AService backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates' chief executive and head of
OL,7,Fpublic service Boley Smillie said the
OL,8,FRevenue Service was "turning that
OL,9,Fcorner" and he was "genuinely very
OL,10,Foptimistic" about the future.
